    <string name="cycle_tips_title">For today</string>
    <string name="cycle_tip_low_intensity">Go lighter: walk, bike, mobility or gentle core; skip max lifts and jumps.</string>
    <string name="cycle_tip_rest">Strong cramps: rest or a short easy walk is fine. Gentle movement can ease the pain.</string>
    <string name="cycle_tip_fatigue">Tired: fewer sets, effort Good, and stop early if your energy drops.</string>
    <string name="cycle_tip_headache">Headache: avoid heavy straining and holding your breath; drink water.</string>
    <string name="cycle_tip_mood">Low mood: a short session you enjoy or a walk outside often helps.</string>
    <string name="cycle_tip_iron">Heavy flow: hydrate and eat iron-rich foods.</string>
    <string name="cycle_ask_coach">Ask Coach how to train today</string>
    <string name="cycle_coach_prompt">Check my cycle and how I feel today, and adapt the workout of today to it: what to keep, what to change and a lighter alternative if I need it.</string>
